<h1 style="margin: 0 0 16px 0; font-size: 22px; line-height: 1.3; color: #1f1b13;">Confirm your email address</h1>

<p style="margin: 0 0 16px 0;">Hi,</p>

<p style="margin: 0 0 16px 0;">Confirm that <strong><%= @email %></strong> is your email address for WIT Calendar.</p>

<%= render "shared/mailer_button", url: confirmation_url(@resource, confirmation_token: @token), label: "Confirm my email address" %>

<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 14px; color: #4d4639;">If you did not ask for this, you can ignore this email.</p>
